  "title": "Mountain Apple Cobbler",
  "description": "Refrigerated crescent roll dough is rolled around apple slices, drizzled with butter and sugar, then topped with the surprise ingredient--a can of Mountain Dew®.",
  "authors": [
    "Leslie Asquith"
  ],
